    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Python Script**\n\nI'm solidifying the blueprint for `batch_translate.py`. My focus is now on establishing Google Cloud Translation API as the go-to translation service, and making its use explicit and easily identifiable in the script.\n\n\n**Pinpointing the API**\n\nI'm now fully committed to using the Google Cloud Translation API via its Python client library, specifically `google.cloud.translate_v3`, to drive the translation functionality in `batch_translate.py`. My primary objective is a function, `batch_translate_strings`, which manages the batch translation using this API. The concrete external dependency will be clear in the code by its import statement.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789820158886,
          "start": 1789820156680
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
